(footprint "Azimuth_5253-100-7R_ButterflyZIF"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "hand")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Azimuth Electronics 5253-100-7R (Reverse) ZIF burn-in socket, single in-line 7 leads @ .100 c/c. Used in facing S+R PAIRS to hold a 14-pin butterfly laser package (e.g. Thorlabs DFB1550LP) with zero insertion force - no soldering to the laser leads. GEOMETRY from Azimuth drawing 12-19E17, 'Footprint (Socket Side of Board)'. Socket outline .500 x 1.500 in (12.70 x 38.10 mm); origin = outline centre = midpoint of the two mounting holes. Contacts are STAGGERED in two columns .125 in (3.17 mm) apart: odd contacts on the column .210 in (5.33 mm) from the datum edge, even contacts .085 in (2.16 mm) from it; vertical pitch .100 in (2.54 mm), 7 contacts spanning .600 in (15.24 mm). Mounting holes .093 in (2.36 mm) clearance for the two #2-56 round-head screws that retain the socket, 1.000 in (25.40 mm) apart, on the column .310 in (7.87 mm) from the datum edge. Contact drill is quoted .036 in (0.91 mm) MIN - 1.0 mm used here as the next standard size at or above that minimum. CONTACT PLANE HEIGHT above this PCB face is .300 in (7.62 mm) at rest and .280 in (7.11 mm) compressed under test, EXCLUDING lead thickness - this sets how far the laser baseplate must stand off the board. Socket accepts straight leads up to .023 in wide x .012 in thick and .150 in (3.81 mm) minimum engaged length - VERIFY the butterfly lead section against this before committing. Contacts BeCu spring temper, 30 uin gold over 30 uin nickel, PPS insulator, -55 to +155 C, rated 4 A continuous / 10 A pulsed (comfortably above the ~2 A TEC leg). PIN 1 IS PLACED AT THE LATCH END and pins run 1..7 away from it: the Azimuth sheet marks 'LATCH END' but does NOT number the contacts, so CONFIRM pin 1 against the physical socket before fabrication. PAIR PLACEMENT: set the S-to-R separation from the measured lead-row spacing of your butterfly package - it is not derivable from this sheet. Latch arm swings open above the board; keep the volume over the socket clear. No manufacturer 3D model is published.")
	(tags "azimuth 5253 zif socket butterfly laser diode 14-pin burn-in 7-lead 0.1in reverse")
	(attr through_hole)

